			"notes": "Minecraft 1.21.1 — Fabric and NeoForge.\nRequires Small Ships 2.0.2 or newer.\n\n- Updated compatibility with Small Ships 2.0.2 and added support for Small Ships Addon and Small Ships Viking Addon.\n- Rebuilt the editor with vanilla-style controls and a larger painting area that adapts to the window size.\n- Improved element selection, camera controls, and zooming around the cursor.\n- Fixed draft synchronization issues that could lose recent edits or overwrite drawings when reopening the table.\n- Fixed inventory synchronization when inserting paper and collecting printed patterns.\n- Added support for banner overlays above custom patterns while preserving visible sail damage.\n- Fixed sail colour restoration after removing or replacing patterns.\n- Improved texture caching and preview cleanup to reduce memory usage.\n- Updated the editor guide, tooltips, and library error messages.\n- Fixed a NeoForge error when leaving a world or stopping a server."
		},
